{"chapter": "algebraization", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0EIT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$I$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{coherent-lemma-existence-easy}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-algebraizable}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-essential-image-completion}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:858c12d44b976de9831fa5ee2c051bf7881a4ad8a33853403c59f8eb5b461d90", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b83db28ebe16926f0301606fd32ae523444791a535dfb85edff30add9f24af42", "source_text": "Part (2) follows immediately from\nCohomology of Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nTo see part (1), we first use Lemma <REF_0002>\nto reduce to the case where <MATH_0001> is <MATH_0002>-adically complete.\nHowever, in that case (1) reduces to (2) by\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c33324d6a382aa6576dc0a0e68b2b8f6769fad0e945aa5b31626594650e92d3a", "unit_id": "tag:0EIU:proof"}
